ding utf8 src/domain/rebar/girder-ends.test.ts; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 src/domain/rebar/stirrup-layout.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in_progress\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_8\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Get-Content -Encoding utf8 docs/ADR.md | Select-String -Pattern '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'^### ADR-002|''^### ADR-008|''^### ADR-012'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"' -Context 0,4; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 src/domain/rebar/girder-ends.test.ts; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 src/domain/rebar/stirrup-layout.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n> ### ADR-002: 룰 로직은 코드, 룰 수치는 데이터(룰팩)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **결정**: 어느 표를 볼지 결정하고 길이를 조합하는 **로직**은 평범한 TS 함수로 쓴다. 그 함수가 읽는 **수치**(定着長さ, 重ね継手長さ, 折曲げ 형상, かぶり厚さ, 할증률)는 `rulepack/*.yaml`에 두고 코드에 리터럴로 쓰지 않는다. 각 항목은 `source`(문서·판·URL·페이지)와 `confidence`(stated|inferred)를 가진다. 룰 DSL이\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n나 평가기는 만들지 않는다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **이유**: 네 가지를 동시에 해결한다. ① 기존 제품(BuilderHub-Q, 鉄之助 등)은 규준이 하드코딩이라 발주처 특기시방서 대응이 벤더 작업이다 — 룰팩 교체가 유일한 차별점이 된다. ② `source`가 있으면 누구든 클릭 한 번으로 대조 검증할 수 있다. ③ PDL1.0의 출처 표시 의무를 자동으로 충족한다. ④ **수치가 코드에 박히면 항목 단위로 `confidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n`를 붙일 수 없어 `inferred` 경고와 워터마크(ADR-015)가 성립하지 않는다.**\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **트레이드오프**: 조회 엔진(조건 매칭)을 만들어야 하고, 하드코딩보다 초기 비용이 높다. 룰팩 스키마를 잘못 설계하면 나중에 전량 마이그레이션이 필요하다. 로직/수치 경계가 애매한 항목(조건 분기 자체가 규준에 적힌 경우)에서는 판단이 필요하다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n> ### ADR-008: 기본 로케일은 `ja`, `ko`는 fallback 보조 로케일\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **결정**: 기본 로케일을 `ja`로 두고, `ko`의 fallback을 `ja`로 설정한다. 한국어는 핵심 문구만 번역한다. 도메인 용어(柱, 大梁, 帯筋, あばら筋, 定着, 重ね継手, SD345, Fc24)는 번역하지 않고 일본어 원어를 고정한다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **이유**: 번역되지 않은 키가 자동으로 일본어로 노출되므로 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"핵심만 한국어\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"가 유지보수 비용 없이 성립한다. 도메인 용어를 번역하면 일본 기준을 구현하면서 한국 개념으로 생각하게 되고, `あばら筋`과 늑근의 미묘한 관행 차이가 조용히 섞인다 — 정확히 개발자가 잡아낼 수 없는 종류의 오류다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **트레이드오프**: 한국어 UI가 군데군데 일본어로 남는다. 일본 진출 시점에는 `ko`를 삭제한다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n> ### ADR-012: 主筋·帯筋 사양은 입력이며 제품이 바꾸지 않는다\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **결정**: 단면일람의 主筋 경·본수, 帯筋/あばら筋 경·피치는 사용자 입력이고 제품이 변경하지 않는다. 룰팩 조회 대상은 定着·重ね継手·折曲げ·かぶり 등 **배근 상세값**으로 한정한다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **이유**: 원래 PRD는 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"主筋 본수·배치를 룰팩에서 조회\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"라고 썼는데 같은 PRD가 단면일람을 입력으로 받았다 — 같은 값을 입력이자 산출로 둔 모순이었다. 더 근본적으로 **主筋 본수는 標準仕様書가 주는 값이 아니라 구조계산 결과**이고 구조도의 柱リスト/梁リスト에서 온다. 룰팩으로 조회할 대상이 애초에 존재하지 않는다. 그리고 이 경계가 제품이 구조설계 책임을 지지 않는 근거\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n가 된다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  **트레이드오프**: 主筋 자동설계를 포기한다. 사용자가 단면일람을 전부 입력해야 하므로 입력량이 늘어난다 — 이것이 UX 리뷰(ADR-010)의 최우선 측정 대상이다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport type { RuleHit, RulePack } from '../rules/types'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { lookupRule } from '../rules/lookup'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { jpMlitRulePack } from '../../rulepack'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  resolveGirderEnd,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  type GirderEndInput,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n} from './girder-ends'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst input: GirderEndInput = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  supportLengthMm: 800,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  barSize: 'D25',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  fc: 24,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  grade: 'SD345',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  bendDirection: '下',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction millimetres(rule: RuleHit, diameter?: number): number {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (rule.unit === 'mm') return rule.value\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (rule.unit === 'd' && diameter !== undefined) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return rule.value * diameter\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  throw new Error(`Unexpected unit for ${rule.key}: ${rule.unit}`)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction columnMinimumCoverRule(pack: RulePack): RuleHit {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const candidates = pack.entries.filter(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ({ key, conditions }) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      key === 'cover.minimum' &&\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      conditions.memberKind === '柱' &&\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      conditions.soilContact !== true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  if (candidates.length === 0) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    throw new Error('No non-soil 柱 cover.minimum rule')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const conservative = candidates.reduce((largest, candidate) =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    candidate.value > largest.value ? candidate : largest,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return lookupRule(pack, conservative.key, conservative.conditions)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction expectedRules(pack: RulePack, supportLengthMm = input.supportLengthMm) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const diameter = Number(input.barSize.replace(/^D/, ''))\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const straight = lookupRule(pack, 'anchorage.L1', {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    fc: input.fc,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    grade: input.grade,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    hook: false,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const bent = lookupRule(pack, 'anchorage.L1h', {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    fc: input.fc,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    grade: input.grade,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    hook: true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const projection = lookupRule(pack, 'anchorage.La', {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    fc: input.fc,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    grade: input.grade,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const tailMinimum = lookupRule(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    pack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    'anchorage.bent.tail.minimum',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    {},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const projectionMinimum = lookupRule(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    pack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    'anchorage.bent.projection.minimum',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    { detail: '梁主筋の柱内定着' },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const minimumCover = columnMinimumCoverRule(pack)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const fabricationAddition = lookupRule(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    pack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    'cover.fabrication.addition',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    {},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const fabricationCoverMm =\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    millimetres(minimumCover) + millimetres(fabricationAddition)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const straightLengthMm = millimetres(straight, diameter)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const projectionMm = Math.max(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    millimetres(projection, diameter),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    supportLengthMm * projectionMinimum.value,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const bentLengthMm = Math.max(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    millimetres(bent, diameter),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    projectionMm + millimetres(tailMinimum, diameter),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    fabricationCoverMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    straightLengthMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    bentLengthMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    projectionMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    rawProjectionMm: millimetres(projection, diameter),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('resolveGirderEnd', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('uses 折曲げ定着 when the sample D25 L1 cannot fit in an 800mm 柱', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const expected = expectedRules(jpMlitRulePack)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(expected.straightLengthMm).toBeGreaterThan(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      input.supportLengthMm - expected.fabricationCoverMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(resolveGirderEnd(input, jpMlitRulePack)).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '折曲げ定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthRule: 'anchorage.L1h',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      projectionRule: 'anchorage.La',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthMm: expected.bentLengthMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      projectionMm: expected.projectionMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      direction: input.bendDirection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('uses 直線定着 when the support is sufficiently large', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const supportLengthMm = 1400\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const expected = expectedRules(jpMlitRulePack, supportLengthMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      resolveGirderEnd(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { ...input, supportLengthMm },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        jpMlitRulePack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '直線定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthRule: 'anchorage.L1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthMm: expected.straightLengthMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('allows 直線定着 exactly at the fabrication-cover boundary', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const expected = expectedRules(jpMlitRulePack)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const supportLengthMm =\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      expected.straightLengthMm + expected.fabricationCoverMm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      resolveGirderEnd(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { ...input, supportLengthMm },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        jpMlitRulePack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '直線定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthRule: 'anchorage.L1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      lengthMm: expected.straightLengthMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when even the 折曲げ projection cannot fit', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const expected = expectedRules(jpMlitRulePack)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const supportLengthMm =\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      expected.fabricationCoverMm + expected.rawProjectionMm - 1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      resolveGirderEnd(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { ...input, supportLengthMm },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        jpMlitRulePack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ).toThrow(/折曲げ定着.*収まらない/)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { jpMlitRulePack } from '../../rulepack'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { lookupRule } from '../rules/lookup'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { stirrupPositions } from './stirrup-layout'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst startOffsetRule = lookupRule(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  jpMlitRulePack,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  'stirrup.start-offset',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('stirrupPositions', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('uses the inferred rule-pack offset and never places a stirrup beyond the interval', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(startOffsetRule).toMatchObject({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      unit: 'mm',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      confidence: 'inferred',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      source: { section: null, page: null },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(startOffsetRule.note).toContain('条文なし')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const layout = stirrupPositions(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      5200,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      150,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startOffsetRule.value,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.positionsMm.at(-1)).toBe(5150)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.positionsMm).not.toContain(5250)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('does not duplicate the interval end when the pitch divides it exactly', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const layout = stirrupPositions(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      5200,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      150,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startOffsetRule.value,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.positionsMm.filter((position) => position === 5150)).toHaveLength(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.lastGapMm).toBe(150)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('adds the interval end when a remainder exists', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const layout = stirrupPositions(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      5250,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      150,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startOffsetRule.value,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.positionsMm.slice(-2)).toEqual([5150, 5200])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(layout.lastGapMm).toBe(50)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('preserves every placement invariant across clear lengths and pitches', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const clearLengths = [500, 1000, 5200, 5250, 6050]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const pitches = [50, 100, 150, 200, 333]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const startOffsetMm = startOffsetRule.value\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    for (const clearMm of clearLengths) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      for (const pitchMm of pitches) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        const { positionsMm, lastGapMm } = stirrupPositions(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          clearMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          pitchMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          startOffsetMm,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        const intervalEndMm = clearMm - startOffsetMm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        expect(positionsMm[0]).toBe(startOffsetMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        expect(positionsMm.at(-1)).toBe(intervalEndMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        expect(new Set(positionsMm).size).toBe(positionsMm.length)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        for (const position of positionsMm) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          expect(position).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(startOffsetMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          expect(position).toBeLessThanOrEqual(intervalEndMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        for (let index = 1; index < positionsMm.length; index += 1) {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          const gap = positionsMm[index] - positionsMm[index - 1]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          expect(gap).toBeGreaterThan(0)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          expect(gap).toBeLessThanOrEqual(pitchMm)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        expect(lastGapMm).toBe(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n          positionsMm.at(-1)! - positionsMm.at(-2)!,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it.each([0, -1])('throws for an invalid pitch %s', (pitchMm) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      stirrupPositions(5200, pitchMm, startOffsetRule.value),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ).toThrow(/pitchMm/)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it.each([100, 99])(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    'throws when the symmetric placement interval cannot be formed for clearMm %s',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    (clearMm) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      expect(() =>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        stirrupPositions(clearMm, 150, startOffsetRule.value),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ).toThrow(/clearMm/)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  )\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.started\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_9\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command 'rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"stirrup.start-offset|anchorage.bent|bend.hook135|cover.minimum|generateGirder|GirderRebar\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" src tests phases; rg --files src/rulepack phases/3-girder-domain'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in_progress\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_9\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\