\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  expr: 40mm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  conditions: { memberKind: 大梁, soilContact: true }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  value: 40\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  unit: mm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  source: { ref: spec, section: 表5.3.6, page: 33 }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  confidence: inferred\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  note: LLM転写 — 独立検討待ち（表5.3.6 土に接する部分）。soilContact 入力が Section に入るまで消費者なし（ADR-005 — 地中部材はスコープ外）\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- key: cover.fabrication.addition\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  label: 加工用かぶり厚さの加算\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  expr: 最小かぶり厚さ + 10mm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  conditions: {}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  value: 10\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  unit: mm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  source: { ref: spec, section: 5.3.5(2), page: 33 }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  confidence: inferred\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  note: LLM転写 — 独立検討待ち。「柱、梁等の鉄筋の加工に用いるかぶり厚さは、最小かぶり厚さに10mmを加えた数値を標準とする」\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.started\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_14\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 phases/3-girder-domain/step4.md; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 src/domain/model/project.test.ts'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"in_progress\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_14\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 phases/3-girder-domain/step4.md; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding utf8 src/domain/model/project.test.ts'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"# Step 4: girder-generator\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n앞 step들의 부품(girderSpan·resolveGirderEnd·stirrupPositions·RebarZone)을 조립해 大梁 배근 생성기를 만든다. 산출은 `[上端筋, 下端筋, あばら筋]` 3행 — column.ts의 「대표 1본 + 本数」 모델을 그대로 따른다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n## 읽어야 할 파일\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n먼저 아래 파일들을 읽고 프로젝트의 아키텍처와 설계 의도를 파악하라:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `/docs/ADR.md` — ADR-002, ADR-008, ADR-012\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/rebar/column.ts` · `column.test.ts` — 생성기 구조·formula 서식·rules 추적·테스트 패턴의 원본\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/model/project.ts` — step 0의 `girderSpan`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/rebar/girder-ends.ts` — step 2의 `resolveGirderEnd`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/rebar/stirrup-layout.ts` — step 3의 `stirrupPositions`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/model/rebar.ts` — step 1의 `RebarZone`(경로거리), role 3종\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `src/domain/model/member.ts` — `GirderSection { b, depth, main: { size, topCount, bottomCount }, stirrup }`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n이전 step에서 만들어진 코드를 꼼꼼히 읽고, 설계 의도를 이해한 뒤 작업하라.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n## 작업\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nTDD로 진행하라. 테스트를 먼저 쓰고 구현하라.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n### 1. `src/domain/rebar/girder.ts` 신설\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n```ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nexport interface GirderRebarInput {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  member: Member\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  section: GirderSection\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  span: GirderSpan\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nexport function generateGirderRebar(input: GirderRebarInput, pack: RulePack): Rebar[]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n// 반환: [上端筋, 下端筋, あばら筋]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n계산 규칙 (부재 로컬 좌표: x=스팬 방향·좌측 柱面 원점, y=梁 밑면 기준, z=폭):\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **上端筋** (`role: '上端筋'`, `count: main.topCount` 입력 그대로 — ADR-012):\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - 양단 각각 `resolveGirderEnd(...)` (bendDirection `'下'`).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - `加工長 = clear + 시작단.lengthMm + 끝단.lengthMm` — 반올림 없음 (M2에서 제거됨).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - `points`: 直線 단부는 x축 직선 연장. 折曲げ 단부는 柱面 안쪽으로 투영 길이만큼 간 뒤 절곡 방향(y)으로 꺾이는 폴리라인 — L2h 전장과 투영·수직 구간의 합이 정합해야 한다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - `zones`: 양단 定着 구간을 **경로거리**로 기록 (`[0, 시작단 길이]`, `[加工長 − 끝단 길이, 加工長]`).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - y 위치는 `depth − 加工用かぶり` (加工用かぶり = cover.minimum{大梁} + fabrication 가산).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **下端筋**: 동일하되 `role: '下端筋'`, `count: bottomCount`, y = 加工用かぶり, bendDirection `'上'`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **あばら筋** (`role: 'あばら筋'`, `shape: 'hoop'`, `closed: true`):\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - `加工長 = 2×{(b − 2×加工用かぶり) + (depth − 2×加工用かぶり)} + 2×hook135余長` — 반올림 없음.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - `count = stirrupPositions(clear, stirrup.pitch, startOffset).positionsMm.length` (startOffset은 `stirrup.start-offset` 조회).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  - points는 Y–Z 평면 사각 후프 (x=0 대표 1본).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- `rules[]`는 실제 조회한 룰만 순서대로. `formula`는 일본어로 값·룰 명칭을 전개하되 **양단 정착이 각각 어느 방식(直線/折曲げ)인지 드러낼 것** — R7 ② (접합부 이중 계상)의 가시화 장치다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n### 2. 테스트 — `src/domain/rebar/girder.test.ts` 신설\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ncolumn.test.ts 패턴(기대값 lookupRule 유도, 실 룰팩, 모킹 없음)으로:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- 3행 생성: role·shape·count가 입력 그대로 (topCount 4 / bottomCount 4 / positions 길이)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- 上端筋 加工長 = clear + 양단 lengthMm (양단이 折曲げ인 케이스 — 샘플 G1 D25·800柱는 折曲げ가 정답)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- 지점이 큰 가상 케이스에서 直線 정착 加工長\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- zones 경로거리 2건과 불변조건 (`0 <= from < to <= 加工長`)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- あばら筋 count가 위치 배열 길이와 일치, 부재 밖 위치 없음\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- 主筋 본수를 재계산하지 않는다는 회귀 (ADR-012)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- rules 실재성(`pack.entries` 키 집합 대조)과 순서 고정\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- formula에 양단 정착 방식·加工用かぶり 값이 드러나는지\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n```bash\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nnpm run lint\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nnpm run typecheck\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nnpm test\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nnpm run test:golden\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nnpm run build\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n```\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n## 검증 절차\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n1. 위 AC 커맨드를 실행한다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n2. 아키텍처 체크리스트:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - 규준 리터럴 없음 (전부 룰 조회)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - `src/domain/` 순수성 유지\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - 도메인 points는 mm 실좌표 — 표시 과장(×1.6 등)은 뷰어 소관이므로 여기 넣지 않는다\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n3. `phases/3-girder-domain/index.json`의 step 4를 업데이트한다:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - 성공 → `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`, `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`에 시그니처·3행 구성·조회 룰 키 목록·로컬 좌표계 정의를 적어라\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - 3회 시도 후 실패 → `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"` + `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error_message\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n   - 진행 불가 → `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocked\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"` + `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocked_reason\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n## 금지사항\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **길이를 10mm 단위로 올림하지 마라.** 이유: 근거 없음이 M0에서 판정됐고 M2가 제거했다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **カットオフ·継手位置·連続 스팬 보정을 넣지 마라.** 이유: M3b 스코프. 이 생성기는 단일 스팬 전용이다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- **useTakeoff를 수정하지 마라.** 이유: step 5의 스코프다. 이 step은 도메인 생성기까지만.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- 기존 테스트를 깨뜨리지 마라.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport type { ColumnSection, GirderSection, Member } from './member'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nimport {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  PROJECT_SCHEMA_VERSION,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  beamDepthAbove,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  columnEnds,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  deserializeProject,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  findSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  girderSpan,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  gridPoint,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  gridPointCount,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  memberGroupKey,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  serializeProject,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  setNote,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  storyElevation,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  type Project,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  type Story,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n} from './project'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst columnSection: ColumnSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  id: 'section-C1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  kind: '柱',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  mark: 'C1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  b: 800,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  d: 800,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  fc: 24,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  grade: 'SD345',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  exposure: '屋外',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  finish: '仕上げなし',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  main: { size: 'D25', count: 12 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  hoop: { size: 'D13', pitch: 100 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst shallowGirderSection: GirderSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  id: 'section-G2',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  mark: 'G2',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  b: 400,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  depth: 700,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  fc: 24,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  grade: 'SD345',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  exposure: '屋外',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  finish: '仕上げなし',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  main: { size: 'D22', topCount: 4, bottomCount: 4 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  stirrup: { size: 'D13', pitch: 150 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst deepGirderSection: GirderSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ...shallowGirderSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  id: 'section-G1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  mark: 'G1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  depth: 750,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nconst column: Member = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  id: '1F-X2Y2',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  kind: '柱',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  sectionId: columnSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  position: { ix: 1, iy: 1 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nfunction createProject(members: Member[] = [column]): Project {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    schemaVersion: PROJECT_SCHEMA_VERSION,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    name: 'テスト案件',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    grid: { xSpans: [6000, 6000], ySpans: [6000, 6000] },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    stories: [{ id: '1F', name: '1階', height: 4200 }],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    sections: [columnSection, shallowGirderSection, deepGirderSection],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    members,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('storyElevation', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const stories: Story[] = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    { id: '1F', name: '1階', height: 4200 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    { id: '2F', name: '2階', height: 3800 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    { id: '3F', name: '3階', height: 3800 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('accumulates the heights of the stories below in array order', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(storyElevation(stories, '1F')).toBe(0)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(storyElevation(stories, '2F')).toBe(4200)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(storyElevation(stories, '3F')).toBe(8000)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('returns 0 for the only story of a single-story project', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(storyElevation([stories[0]], '1F')).toBe(0)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws on an unknown story id', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => storyElevation(stories, 'RF')).toThrow('Story not found: RF')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('grid helpers', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('returns grid point counts and cumulative coordinates in mm', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const grid = { xSpans: [1000, 2000], ySpans: [500] }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(gridPointCount(grid)).toEqual({ nx: 3, ny: 2 })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(gridPoint(grid, 2, 1)).toEqual({ x: 3000, y: 500 })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it.each([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    [-1, 0],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    [0, -1],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    [3, 0],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    [0, 3],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ])('throws for an out-of-range grid index (%s, %s)', (ix, iy) => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => gridPoint(createProject().grid, ix, iy)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('project lookup helpers', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('finds a section and throws when the section is absent', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = createProject()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(findSection(project, 'section-C1')).toEqual(columnSection)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => findSection(project, 'missing')).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"uses Story.name, C/G and 符号 for the fixed group-key format\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(memberGroupKey(createProject(), column)).toBe('1階|C|C1')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('returns the greatest depth among same-story 大梁 touching the 柱', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const members: Member[] = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      column,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        id: '1F-G2-X1Y2-X',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        sectionId: shallowGirderSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        position: { axis: 'X', ix: 0, iy: 1 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        id: '1F-G1-X2Y2-Y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        sectionId: deepGirderSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        position: { axis: 'Y', ix: 1, iy: 1 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        id: '1F-G1-X1Y1-X',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        sectionId: deepGirderSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        position: { axis: 'X', ix: 0, iy: 0 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(beamDepthAbove(createProject(members), column)).toBe(750)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when no same-story 大梁 touches the 柱', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => beamDepthAbove(createProject(), column)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('girderSpan', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const rectangularColumnSection: ColumnSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...columnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    id: 'section-C-rectangular',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    mark: 'C-rectangular',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    b: 700,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    d: 900,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const narrowColumnSection: ColumnSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...columnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    id: 'section-C-narrow',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    mark: 'C-narrow',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    b: 600,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const wideColumnSection: ColumnSection = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ...columnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    id: 'section-C-wide',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    mark: 'C-wide',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    b: 1000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function supportColumn(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    id: string,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    sectionId: string,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ix: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    iy: number,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ): Member {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '柱',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sectionId,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      position: { ix, iy },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function girder(axis: 'X' | 'Y'): Member {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      id: `1F-G1-${axis}`,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sectionId: deepGirderSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      position: { axis, ix: 0, iy: 0 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function spanProject(members: Member[]): Project {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...createProject(members),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      grid: { xSpans: [6000], ySpans: [6000] },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sections: [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        columnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        rectangularColumnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        narrowColumnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        wideColumnSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        shallowGirderSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        deepGirderSection,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('calculates the X-axis clear span between two 800 mm 柱 faces', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = girder('X')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = spanProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('start', columnSection.id, 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('end', columnSection.id, 1, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      member,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(girderSpan(project, member)).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      axis: 'X',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      centerSpan: 6000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      clear: 5200,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startFaceOffsetMm: 400,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endFaceOffsetMm: 400,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 800,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 800,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('uses d as the support length for a Y-axis girder', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = girder('Y')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = spanProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('start', rectangularColumnSection.id, 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('end', rectangularColumnSection.id, 0, 1),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      member,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(girderSpan(project, member)).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      axis: 'Y',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      centerSpan: 6000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      clear: 5100,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startFaceOffsetMm: 450,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endFaceOffsetMm: 450,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 900,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 900,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('uses each end support dimension independently', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = girder('X')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = spanProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('start', narrowColumnSection.id, 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('end', wideColumnSection.id, 1, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      member,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(girderSpan(project, member)).toMatchObject({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      clear: 5200,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startFaceOffsetMm: 300,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endFaceOffsetMm: 500,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      startSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 600,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      endSupportLengthAlongAxisMm: 1000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when either end support 柱 is missing', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = girder('X')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = spanProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      supportColumn('start', columnSection.id, 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      member,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => girderSpan(project, member)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when passed a 柱 member', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = supportColumn('start', columnSection.id, 0, 0)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => girderSpan(spanProject([member]), member)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when the support faces leave no positive clear span', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const member = girder('X')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project: Project = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...spanProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        supportColumn('start', columnSection.id, 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        supportColumn('end', columnSection.id, 1, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        member,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ]),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      grid: { xSpans: [800], ySpans: [6000] },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => girderSpan(project, member)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('project serialization', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('round-trips a Project with deep equality', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = createProject()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(deserializeProject(serializeProject(project))).toEqual(project)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('throws when schemaVersion does not match', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = createProject()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const incompatible = JSON.stringify({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...project,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      schemaVersion: PROJECT_SCHEMA_VERSION + 1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => deserializeProject(incompatible)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('round-trips 備考 notes', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = setNote(createProject(), '1階|C|C1|主筋', '要確認')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(deserializeProject(serializeProject(project))).toEqual(project)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('columnEnds', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function stackColumn(storyId: string, ix: number, iy: number): Member {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      id: `${storyId}-X${ix + 1}Y${iy + 1}`,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '柱',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sectionId: 'section-C1',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      storyId,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      position: { ix, iy },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  function stackProject(members: Member[]): Project {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    return {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...createProject(members),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      stories: [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { id: '1F', name: '1階', height: 4200 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { id: '2F', name: '2階', height: 3600 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  const twoStories = [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    stackColumn('1F', 1, 1),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    stackColumn('2F', 1, 1),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  ]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('anchors into the foundation at the lowest story and hands the joint upwards', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = stackProject(twoStories)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(project, twoStories[0])).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bottom: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      top: 'なし',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('makes the upper column carry the 継手 and anchor at the roof', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = stackProject(twoStories)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(project, twoStories[1])).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bottom: '継手',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      top: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('anchors at both ends when the column stands alone in its stack', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = stackProject([twoStories[0]])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(project, twoStories[0])).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bottom: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      top: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('ignores a column that sits on a different grid point', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = stackProject([\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      stackColumn('1F', 1, 1),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      stackColumn('2F', 0, 0),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    ])\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(project, stackColumn('1F', 1, 1))).toEqual({\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      bottom: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      top: '定着',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('reads the stack order from the stories array', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const reversed: Project = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ...stackProject(twoStories),\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      stories: [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { id: '2F', name: '2階', height: 3600 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n        { id: '1F', name: '1階', height: 4200 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      ],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    // 배열이 뒤집히면 2F가 최하층으로 해석된다 — 순서가 곧 스택이다.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(reversed, twoStories[1]).bottom).toBe('定着')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(columnEnds(reversed, twoStories[0]).bottom).toBe('継手')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('rejects a member that is not a 柱', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const beam: Member = {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      id: '1F-G1-X1Y1-X',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      kind: '大梁',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      memberClass: '躯体',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      sectionId: shallowGirderSection.id,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      storyId: '1F',\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      position: { axis: 'X', ix: 0, iy: 0 },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(() => columnEnds(stackProject(twoStories), beam)).toThrow()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n})\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndescribe('setNote', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('stores a note without mutating the original Project', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = createProject()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const next = setNote(project, '1階|C|C1|主筋', '要確認')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(next.notes).toEqual({ '1階|C|C1|主筋': '要確認' })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(project.notes).toBeUndefined()\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it('replaces an existing note for the same line', () => {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const project = setNote(createProject(), '1階|C|C1|主筋', '要確認')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    const next = setNote(project, '1階|C|C1|主筋', '確認済')\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    expect(next.notes).toEqual({ '1階|C|C1|主筋': '確認済' })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  })\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  it(